==============================================================================
REFRAME 7: others-clear as a simultaneous congruence-interval system
==============================================================================

[0] Named covering cases: M-tool vs band-reformulation
  generic core-core {1..5,7..13,84}
     M-tool      M=2/23  tau*=4/23  (D=23, num=4)
     band-reform M=2/23 at (D,num)=(23, 4)  AGREE=True
     band [k=2,D-k=21] at level 1/14 (c=ceil(D/14)=2): #num in [1,22] clearing ALL 13 at level>=1/14 = 2
        clearing num: [4, 19]
  resonant flank-w {1..11,13,84}
     M-tool      M=7/89  tau*=37/89  (D=89, num=37)
     band-reform M=7/89 at (D,num)=(89, 37)  AGREE=True
